# The image keeps the 255 most frequent function records in a table of their own. A function with another record is marked, and the runtime looks up its record by the function's number.
# Here the runtime does that for the frames of an error's stack.
# Fault injection, testing=MisnumberFunctionRecords: all records except the most frequent one are listed by function, each under the number after its own.
# In every build the runtime checks that the entry it found exists and carries the requested number. Otherwise the process crashes.
# AS-USERS-BUILD: the run time asks the row in every build.
# RUN(RIGHT): run-in-shell mechanisms=all
# RIGHT: has frames string
# RIGHT-NEXT: exited with 0
# RUN(HELD): run-in-shell mechanisms=all testing=MisnumberFunctionRecords
# HELD: crashed with SIGABRT
# -- source: main.ts
